id: P-add-aspect-with-anchors
name: Add an aspect with code anchors
description: Add a cross-cutting concern (~aspect) with required code anchors pointing to real source locations
trigger:
  - add aspect
  - new aspect
  - cross-cutting rule
  - enforcement aspect
tags:
  - aspect
  - enforcement
  - cross-cutting
symbols: []
exemplar: packages/paradigm/.purpose
steps:
  - action: modify
    target: '{directory}/.purpose'
    reference: aspects section
    notes: |
      Add aspect definition:
        ~{name}:
          description: "What this aspect enforces"
          category: constraint|decision|compliance
          severity: high|medium|low
          tags: [relevant, tags]
          anchors:
            - src/path/to/file.ts:LINE-LINE
          applies-to:
            - "#affected-component"
  - action: verify
    notes: Anchors MUST point to existing code locations. Run paradigm drift check to verify anchors are valid. Aspect without anchors will fail validation.
